<item>
    <title>Version 0.0.2-beta.7</title>
    <sparkle:version>7</sparkle:version>
    <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.0.2-beta.7</sparkle:shortVersionString>
    <sparkle:channel>beta</sparkle:channel>
    <pubDate>Fri, 14 Nov 2025 21:47:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[
        <h2>📋 What's New</h2>
        <p>View full <a href="https://github.com/vimo-ai/mcp-router/releases/tag/v0.0.2-beta.7">release notes</a>.</p>

        <h3>⚠️ Important Notice</h3>
        <p><strong>This version optimizes database storage.</strong> Your configuration will be migrated automatically.</p>
        <p><strong style="color: #ff6b6b;">⚡️ HIGHLY RECOMMENDED: Export your configuration backup before updating!</strong></p>
        <ol>
            <li>Open Settings → Export Configuration</li>
            <li>Save backup file</li>
            <li>Then proceed with update</li>
        </ol>
        <p>If configuration is lost after update:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Check Console.app logs for migration status</li>
            <li>Use Settings → Import Configuration to restore</li>
        </ul>

        <hr/>

        <h3>⚠️ 重要提示</h3>
        <p><strong>本版本优化了数据存储方式。</strong>您的配置会自动迁移。</p>
        <p><strong style="color: #ff6b6b;">⚡️ 强烈建议：升级前请先导出配置备份！</strong></p>
        <ol>
            <li>打开设置 → 导出配置</li>
            <li>保存备份文件</li>
            <li>然后再升级</li>
        </ol>
        <p>如果升级后配置丢失：</p>
        <ul>
            <li>查看控制台日志检查迁移状态</li>
            <li>通过设置 → 导入配置恢复数据</li>
        </ul>
    ]]></description>
